{"doc_id": "doc19431", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the television series Drake & Josh, the character Walter serves as Josh's father and is also the stepfather to Drake and Megan. Walter works as a meteorologist at a local TV news station in San Diego, though he frequently makes incorrect weather predictions. His personality is often characterized as clumsy, outdated, and lacking intelligence, which contributes to him not receiving much respect from his stepchildren. They typically refer to him by his first name, a habit he seems unaware of until reminded. There's a recurring comedic element involving his rivalry with an unseen weatherman named Bruce Winchill from another station, whom Walter perceives as overly popular and consistently accurate. This dynamic, along with Walter's gradual realization of Megan's prank-related antics (starting in the episode \"The Demonator\"), forms a significant part of the show's narrative.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 1737632995, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "609da800f28264d28ae47de26d1baa2918b5f24e6a634672e9c867e10000e3e3", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Jonathan Goldstein", "matched_aliases": ["Jonathan Goldstein"], "query_id": "test536", "question_hash": "1b4b53b8a0be245cc7373c228b0a8fc235568714518ccf110d8c86cf18a43e3b", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "db0d30cd363e0cab9de637c91f21b9850bf41dc48face820e430755ad26565d4", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1401705821, "similarity": 0.05709487825356843, "source_content_hash": "d619d321711b921d7bc10ec2f57bf636d339defbc20cbdbf83a975b5d6f67fc5", "source_hash": "2300a39974e177b1d7024dfa61cbe96d4a93dee177b1076d063281fed9989f92", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "e55cf6a61499e7c8f67779d77b33f186332a2e704dbcb2a4bf8fde26